    "body": "Thanks for the quick review.\r\n\r\nNot sure what I should do with the proposed changes, is it ok to integrate things in this PR and the tests PR? That's what I'm doing but let me know if that's not the case.\r\n\r\nSome comments about the review:\r\n* D1: [inert elements are not focusable](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#focusable-area), so it's kind of a duplicated test (we can add it, but it's already covered by the non focusable element). Regarding `preventScroll: false`, that's the [IDL default](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#focusoptions) and is already covered by `focus-already-focused-no-scroll.html`, do we need to test explicitly `preventScroll: false`?\r\n* D2: That makes sense, I have integrated that into this PR and the tests PR.\r\n* Q1: I think we can do a) as it's in alignment with the proposed change in this PR. I have also integrated that.\r\n* Q2: I have filled https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/13280 about that, I think we can resolve it on its own.\r\n\r\nThere's also https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/13279, but again seems something separated from this PR.",
